[I] A professional FREE and open source painting program

[T] Krita is a professional FREE and open source painting program.

[U] https://krita.org/

[A] The KDE-Team
[M] René Rebe <rene@exactco.de>

[C] extra/graphic extra/desktop/kde
[F] CROSS OBJDIR

[L] GPL
[V] 6.0.5

[D] 5043fd5a157760da2087dd5816c0b0bf47143c27449e94624940086e krita-6.0.5.tar.xz https://download.kde.org/stable/krita/6.0.5/

. $base/package/*/*/kde-conf.in

var_append cmakeopt ' ' -DBUILD_WITH_QT6=ON
var_append cmakeopt ' ' -DALLOW_UNSTABLE=QT6
var_append cmakeopt ' ' -DKRITA_ENABLE_PCH=ON
var_append CXX_WRAPPER_APPEND ' ' "-L$root$(pkgprefix libdir glib)"

atstage cross &&
	var_append cmakeopt ' ' "-DTIFF_HAS_PSD_TAGS=1 -DTIFF_CAN_WRITE_PSD_TAGS=1"
